      "definitionZh": "协调韧性是局部暂时失效、偏离或退出后，整体仍能维持基本协调，并留有时间重新配置的能力。",
      "definitionEn": "Coordination resilience is the capacity to maintain basic coordination and retain time to reconfigure when a part temporarily fails, deviates, or exits.",
